  "contentHtml": "<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><br></b>학기말 칼질로 다시 한번 <br><b><u>손목을 풀어보고자</u></b> <br><b><span style=\"color: #EE2323;\">새 아이템</span></b>을 마련해봅니다. ^^;;;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/370742f721ca9f2c9605ed772470279097451b93_re_1671514553733\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/370742f721ca9f2c9605ed772470279097451b93_re_1671514553733\" data-origin-width=\"1357\" data-origin-height=\"638\"></div><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><br>여.....영혼 1g을 다시금 팔아봅니</b>.....음화화화 ㅠㅡㅠ</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/05d749bc72f1312dc268a678d79bbc766d30d303_re_1671514553733\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/05d749bc72f1312dc268a678d79bbc766d30d303_re_1671514553733\" data-origin-width=\"1536\" data-origin-height=\"1152\"></div><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><br>앞장</b>과</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/3fa88f420c4377987d07c6108b2c85cb3b225a02_re_1671514553733\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/3fa88f420c4377987d07c6108b2c85cb3b225a02_re_1671514553733\" data-origin-width=\"1536\" data-origin-height=\"1152\"></div><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><br>뒷장</b>을 <b>양면인쇄하여 (반드시 <span style=\"color: #EE2323;\">&quot;짧은 쪽 묶음&quot;</span>)<br><br></b></p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/3fc9f0594b89a7380392a6db9cc232c5e1270327_re_1671514553733\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/3fc9f0594b89a7380392a6db9cc232c5e1270327_re_1671514553733\" data-origin-width=\"1536\" data-origin-height=\"1152\"></div><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><br><b>50장을</b> 칼질로 완성....하려다 아니될듯하여<br><b><span style=\"color: #5733B1;\">작두로 부지런히 작두질</span></b>을 하였습니다.&#160;<br>&#160;<br><b>&quot;타임라인&quot;</b> 이라는 게임을 아시는지요?</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/4ed10b6108736848057ca8b1c17e1d5ea1faae1b_re_1671514553733\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/4ed10b6108736848057ca8b1c17e1d5ea1faae1b_re_1671514553733\" data-origin-width=\"518\" data-origin-height=\"514\"></div><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><br>품절되고 아직 만들 계획이 없다는<br>과학사의 사건들을 연도순으로 나열하는 <br>&quot;과학의 발견&quot; 버젼입니다.&#160;<br>&#160;<br><b><u>타임라인과 룰은 같습니다.</u></b><br>&#160;<br><b><span style=\"color: #EE2323;\">학기 말 중3 과정의 내용들을 되짚어 </span></b><br><b><span style=\"color: #EE2323;\">순열해보는 게임</span></b>입니다.&#160;<br>&#160;<br>그럼, 설명 가보겠습니다!</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/e2b7b600775261d11a9039fc8d74eb1b40c18473_re_1671514553731\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/e2b7b600775261d11a9039fc8d74eb1b40c18473_re_1671514553731\" data-origin-width=\"1638\" data-origin-height=\"1092\"></div><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><br>카드는 <b><span style=\"color: #1A5490;\">앞 뒤에 </span></b><br><b><span style=\"color: #1A5490;\">같은 과학 개념</span></b>이나 주제가 써있습니다.&#160;<br>&#160;<br><span style=\"color: #EF6F53;\"><u>앞면에는 <b>단원</b></u><b><u> 순서가 없이 &quot; ? &quot;</u></b></span> 가, <br><b><u><span style=\"color: #409D00;\">뒷면에는 단원순서</span></u></b>가 있습니다.&#160;<br>&#160;<br><b><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">③ - 5 란</span></b><br>3단원 5번째 주제란 뜻입니다.&#160;<br>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/99112ea268724045502f7bfaa9967bb6e68913fe_re_1671514553731\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/99112ea268724045502f7bfaa9967bb6e68913fe_re_1671514553731\" data-origin-width=\"1536\" data-origin-height=\"1152\"></div><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><span style=\"color: #5F6D2B;\"><br>단원이 없는 쪽</span></b>으로 쌓아서 Start!</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/7d236eb9442afb1135a2b642896992ddb0503a62_re_1671514553731\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/7d236eb9442afb1135a2b642896992ddb0503a62_re_1671514553731\" data-origin-width=\"1536\" data-origin-height=\"1152\"></div><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><span style=\"color: #5733B1;\"><br>개인별 7장씩 배부</span></b> (무지개색 7개~!)<br>&#160;<br>왼쪽 하단에 <u><b>더미 (남은 카드 쌓아놓기)</b> </u>를 모셔놓습니다.&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/cd55e5d11d09b10e94f1b273d0f1227c5851787d_re_1671514553731\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/cd55e5d11d09b10e94f1b273d0f1227c5851787d_re_1671514553731\" data-origin-width=\"1536\" data-origin-height=\"1152\"></div><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><br>기준이 되는 <b><span style=\"color: #F89009;\">카드 1장을 가운데</span></b>에 둡니다.</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/e4f2c23ef0db823482f3977d4abc3f5075d74acc_re_1671514553731\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/e4f2c23ef0db823482f3977d4abc3f5075d74acc_re_1671514553731\" data-origin-width=\"1536\" data-origin-height=\"1152\"></div><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><br>가운데 카드는 <b><span style=\"color: #006DD7;\">뒤집어 단원 순서를 OPEN!<u><br></u></span></b></p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/e3f00d8e8e13f7a155031aee0629882568bb1731_re_1671514553731\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/e3f00d8e8e13f7a155031aee0629882568bb1731_re_1671514553731\" data-origin-width=\"1043\" data-origin-height=\"757\"></div><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><br>&lt;룰&gt;은 아주 심플합니다.</b><br>&#160;<br>가운데 카드를 &lt;기준&gt;으로&#160;<br>학생들은 <b><span style=\"color: #EE2323;\">자기 차례에 <br>카드 1장씩 내려놓을 수 있고,</span></b><br><u><b><span style=\"color: #1A5490;\">가장 먼저 7장을 모두 내려놓는 사람</span></b>이 승자!<br></u></p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/5914987636d16ddff8b71f7de4a886ca96e214ba_re_1671514553731\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/5914987636d16ddff8b71f7de4a886ca96e214ba_re_1671514553731\" data-origin-width=\"1043\" data-origin-height=\"757\"></div><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><br>기준 카드에 대해<br><b><span style=\"color: #EE2323;\">앞 단원 내용이면 왼쪽</span></b>에, <br><b><span style=\"color: #0DB4A0;\"> 뒤라면 오른쪽</span></b>에 두면 OK!</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/6b86b9c435813b211d7432b499d69dd917a07f1d_re_1671514553730\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/6b86b9c435813b211d7432b499d69dd917a07f1d_re_1671514553730\" data-origin-width=\"1536\" data-origin-height=\"1152\"></div><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><br>우주는 최근에 배웠으니<br><b><span style=\"color: #8A3DB6;\">뒤!!!! 오른쪽</span></b>에 놓았네요!</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/b82df059398bcb2a094352671dd10f502d69c42a_re_1671514553730\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/b82df059398bcb2a094352671dd10f502d69c42a_re_1671514553730\" data-origin-width=\"1536\" data-origin-height=\"1152\"></div><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><br>카드 OPEN!&#160;<br><br>오~~~ 7단원이 뒤가 맞았습니다.<br><b><u>안전하게 카드 1장을 잘 버렸네요.<br></u></b></p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/ddae8391dd873fa6c7b8afc992f6d366dd0fe58b_re_1671514553732\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/ddae8391dd873fa6c7b8afc992f6d366dd0fe58b_re_1671514553732\" data-origin-width=\"1536\" data-origin-height=\"1152\"></div><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><br>이제 2장이 깔렸습니다.&#160;<br><b><u><span style=\"color: #EE2323;\">추가 놓을 수 있는 곳은 3곳!<br></span></u></b></p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/5a1876babcdcd0fcef101349d4588901e0f1a029_re_1671514553732\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/5a1876babcdcd0fcef101349d4588901e0f1a029_re_1671514553732\" data-origin-width=\"1536\" data-origin-height=\"1152\"></div><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #8A3DB6;\"><b><br>좌! 중! 우!</b> </span>되겠습니다.&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/545886157afca550899598dc2cc4bcf50f5a4013_re_1671514553732\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/545886157afca550899598dc2cc4bcf50f5a4013_re_1671514553732\" data-origin-width=\"1536\" data-origin-height=\"1152\"></div><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><br>물리변화, 화학변화<br>배운지 오렌지죠. <b><span style=\"color: #EE2323;\">맨 앞</span>을 선택합니다!<br></b></p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/96cb3e85dcadf1f66064af86346e297460d0d9a3_re_1671514553732\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/96cb3e85dcadf1f66064af86346e297460d0d9a3_re_1671514553732\" data-origin-width=\"1536\" data-origin-height=\"1152\"></div><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><br>카드 OPEN!&#160;<br></b><br>맞았습니다~! 잘 버렸네요.&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/1393cc290f2fd283c8f6f98b2acc225e77549d4b_re_1671514553732\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/1393cc290f2fd283c8f6f98b2acc225e77549d4b_re_1671514553732\" data-origin-width=\"1536\" data-origin-height=\"1152\"></div><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><br>이젠 <b><u><span style=\"color: #0DB4A0;\">놓을 수 있는 곳이 4군데!</span></u></b><br>점점 범위가 <b>세밀</b>해져가네요.</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/04ec1a93085afbf728d03280eaa8376406403c82_re_1671514553732\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/04ec1a93085afbf728d03280eaa8376406403c82_re_1671514553732\" data-origin-width=\"1536\" data-origin-height=\"1152\"></div><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><br>바람, 해륙풍&#160;<br>어느 단원일까요?<br><br>5단원과 7단원 사이를 골랐습니다!<br>&#160;<br><b>과연..... 두둥<br></b></p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/319d0f9d5dc7254e218d24871c72a30a0a1e4466_re_1671514553732\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/319d0f9d5dc7254e218d24871c72a30a0a1e4466_re_1671514553732\" data-origin-width=\"1536\" data-origin-height=\"1152\"></div><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><br>카드 OPEN!</b><br>&#160;<br>아악! 2단원이였네요. <b><span style=\"color: #EE2323;\">실패 ㅠㅡㅠ<br></span></b></p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/6467e98b3d7b3935ded0576f055d73602d2112ff_re_1671514553731\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/6467e98b3d7b3935ded0576f055d73602d2112ff_re_1671514553731\" data-origin-width=\"1536\" data-origin-height=\"1152\"></div><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><br>순서를 잘못 놓았을 경우,&#160;<br><br><b><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">벌로</span></b> <b><u><span style=\"color: #006DD7;\">더미에서 1장을 새로 먹고<br></span></u></b><br><b>카드는 바른 위치에 놓은 후,</b> 이어 진행합니다.&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/d1f0576bb4bb5b8c2e582abdae719ffa67128a72_re_1671514553730\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/d1f0576bb4bb5b8c2e582abdae719ffa67128a72_re_1671514553730\" data-origin-width=\"1536\" data-origin-height=\"1152\"></div><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><br>벌써 여러 턴이 돌아<br>자리가 많이 <b><span style=\"color: #0DB4A0;\">좁아지고</span></b> 있습니다.&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/7bf12eb322e8fb552fa55973f0a01adfa64f4025_re_1671514553731\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/7bf12eb322e8fb552fa55973f0a01adfa64f4025_re_1671514553731\" data-origin-width=\"1536\" data-origin-height=\"1152\"></div><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><br>너무 길어지면<br>이렇게 <b><u><span style=\"color: #EF6F53;\">2줄로 배치</span></u></b>를 해도 됩니다.<br>&#160;<br>제가 중3을 담당하여, <br>중3만......만들어 봅니다. 하하하<br>&#160;<br>컬러 프린트가 <span style=\"color: #006DD7;\"><b>기능이 쌩쌩하면</b> </span>아주 아름다운 색감으로 뽑힙니다.&#160;<br>&#160;<br>학년말 중3,<br>수능친 고3의 자세를 보이는 녀석들과 <br>함께합니다.&#160;PEACE!<br><br>^ㅡ^</p><div class=\"figure-file\" data-ke-type=\"file\" data-file-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/9b9ea498024983c80bfe7d3f46ac21a22b46df0e_re_1671514553730?download\" data-file-name=\"단원순서맞추기게임.hwp\" data-file-size=\"1422336\" data-mimetype=\"application/haansofthwp\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\"><a href=\"javascript:checkVirus('grpid%3D1TaBA%26fldid%3DfMHw%26dataid%3D421%26fileid%3D25%26regdt%3D20221220230433&url=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafeattach%2F1TaBA%2F9b9ea498024983c80bfe7d3f46ac21a22b46df0e_re_1671514553730')\"><div class=\"image\"></div><div class=\"desc\"><div class=\"filename\"><span class=\"name\">단원순서맞추기게임</span><span class=\"type\">.hwp</span></div><div class=\"size\">1.36MB</div></div></a></div>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->"
}